+//   - PLAY: the cursor stays the game's; pinned panels show, click-through (pointer-events none) - except a `live`
+//     panel (def.live), which keeps the mouse: it is reached whenever the game frees the cursor (the Overworld, a menu).
 //   - EDIT (the toggle key): the pointer lock is released and every open panel takes the mouse.
