+// ui/enhanced/enhancedTrade.js: the Sell helper's DOOR (panels/sell.js) - added at the file's foot, no line of the window's
+// own is changed. Each arm is one of the window's OWN acts, with every refusal it has: a row's click is pickLocal (the
+// pack's click - its law, its how-many, its refusals), a counter row's is pickRemote, Sell junk is the window's own
